# CI optimisation evidence: the reports and measurements this branch is
# judged against. Reports, CSVs and manifests are tracked; the multi-MB raw
# run logs and JUnit XML stay ignored - they are reproducible from the
# scripts in ci/ and would bloat every clone.
!artifacts/ci_optimisation/
!artifacts/ci_optimisation/**/
!artifacts/ci_optimisation/**/*.md
!artifacts/ci_optimisation/**/*.csv
!artifacts/ci_optimisation/*.md
!artifacts/ci_optimisation/*.csv
!artifacts/ci_optimisation/*.json
artifacts/ci_optimisation/**/*.log
artifacts/ci_optimisation/**/*.xml
artifacts/ci_optimisation/wide/
artifacts/ci_optimisation/xdist/

# Governed-artifact reproducibility evidence: the pack reproducibility
# matrix, the R2 writer/worker matrices, the uncertainty re-centring audits
# and the reports they support. Same rule as above - reports, CSVs, JSON and
# the small value-difference parquet are tracked; raw run logs stay ignored
# and are reproducible from ci/probe_governed_pack_reproducibility.sh and
# ci/phase_b_r2_matrix.sh.
!artifacts/governed_artifact_reproducibility/
!artifacts/governed_artifact_reproducibility/**/
!artifacts/governed_artifact_reproducibility/*.md
!artifacts/governed_artifact_reproducibility/*.csv
!artifacts/governed_artifact_reproducibility/*.json
!artifacts/governed_artifact_reproducibility/*.parquet
!artifacts/governed_artifact_reproducibility/**/*.md
!artifacts/governed_artifact_reproducibility/**/*.csv
!artifacts/governed_artifact_reproducibility/**/*.json
artifacts/governed_artifact_reproducibility/**/*.log
# The per-probe raw diff parquets are multi-MB and reproducible from the
# probe scripts; the collated top-level pack_value_differences.parquet is
# tracked (it is the value-level record the report cites).
artifacts/governed_artifact_reproducibility/raw_phase_a/**/*.parquet
artifacts/governed_artifact_reproducibility/raw_phase_b_prefix/**/*.parquet
artifacts/governed_artifact_reproducibility/raw_final/**/*.parquet
# Issue #31: evidence that normal app startup is read-only for governed
# chart-source files. Small JSON/CSV/markdown only; no server or browser logs.
!artifacts/r2_app_boot_read_only/
!artifacts/r2_app_boot_read_only/**
# Engine-keyed diagnostic chart sources are regenerable output, never governed
# evidence. scripts/promote_chart_sources.py --engine ar1 writes here.
artifacts/diagnostics/chart_sources/
